    "section": "Event Companion",
    "summary": "Players alternate setting up units, the Defender first; units in **[strategic reserves](vsdata:core-rule/strategic-reserves)** are not set up.\n\n- Each time, set up 1 unit wholly within your deployment zone.\n- Setting up a **TITANIC** unit costs you your next set-up turn.\n- Once one player has finished, the other sets up all their remaining units.",
